WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.001
- Joel, there was some tricks.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.983
You guys were shooting
in some very cold weather

00:00:03.983 --> 00:00:05.759
and Will was very helpful with that.

00:00:05.759 --> 00:00:06.644
Was he not?

00:00:06.644 --> 00:00:09.194
- I mean there was, they have rain towers

00:00:09.194 --> 00:00:12.577
that they like took from
the ground water in Toronto.

00:00:12.577 --> 00:00:14.187
It was like icy cold.

00:00:14.187 --> 00:00:16.748
We were all just like miserable in that.

00:00:16.748 --> 00:00:19.313
And then Will had the
brilliant idea of getting in,

00:00:19.313 --> 00:00:22.708
like the bucket of steaming hot water.

00:00:22.708 --> 00:00:23.541
- [Will] Yeah.

00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:24.499
- And he'd get this little bucket

00:00:24.499 --> 00:00:25.850
and he'd like sneak up to people

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.729
that were like standing
and shivering to death

00:00:27.729 --> 00:00:29.511
and then he'd like pour
it down their necks.

00:00:29.511 --> 00:00:31.353
And you could just like
see people standing there

00:00:31.353 --> 00:00:33.425
and then they were like
(moans in appreciation)

00:00:33.425 --> 00:00:34.433
(laughing)

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:35.266
It was like...

00:00:35.266 --> 00:00:36.391
- [Will] Yeah.
- [Joel] It was sensual.

00:00:36.391 --> 00:00:37.224
- It was so not!

00:00:37.224 --> 00:00:39.061
(laughing loudly)

00:00:39.061 --> 00:00:40.164
And you could see like,

00:00:40.164 --> 00:00:42.029
and he was going around
and he was running around

00:00:42.029 --> 00:00:43.471
like a little kid in the candy store.

00:00:43.471 --> 00:00:45.041
He was like (giggling)

00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:45.988
(laughing loudly)

00:00:45.988 --> 00:00:46.903
And he was like pouring it.

00:00:46.903 --> 00:00:48.122
And then it like caught on,

00:00:48.122 --> 00:00:49.719
so everybody was taking
these little buckets

00:00:49.719 --> 00:00:51.016
and like pouring on each other.

00:00:51.016 --> 00:00:52.850
It was time like a little weird.

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:54.263
(laughing loudly)

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:55.275
Everybody was like,
- [Voiceover] A little weird.

00:00:55.275 --> 00:00:57.086
- Everybody was like (moans loudly)

00:00:57.086 --> 00:00:58.504
(laughing)

00:00:58.504 --> 00:01:00.812
And the whole crew was
like looking at us like--

00:01:00.812 --> 00:01:01.645
- Get me, Joel.

00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:02.478
Get me, get me.

00:01:02.478 --> 00:01:04.718
(laughing loudly)

00:01:04.718 --> 00:01:05.551
I got you.

00:01:05.551 --> 00:01:06.989
I got you, bro.

00:01:06.989 --> 00:01:08.362
(moans loudly)
- Man.

00:01:08.362 --> 00:01:09.681
(laughing loudly)

00:01:09.681 --> 00:01:10.588
- Oh, Joel. Thank you.

00:01:10.588 --> 00:01:13.282
(laughing loudly)

00:01:13.282 --> 00:01:14.881
- You want a little spa though.

00:01:14.881 --> 00:01:16.103
- [Will] Yeah!
- [Voiceover] A little spa!

00:01:16.103 --> 00:01:17.103
I like that.

00:01:18.083 --> 00:01:19.156
- And then the sound guys,

00:01:19.156 --> 00:01:20.660
they were not so happy.

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:22.343
Cause we were pouring water...

00:01:22.343 --> 00:01:23.639
- [Both] Into their microphones.

00:01:23.639 --> 00:01:24.472
- Yeah.

00:01:24.472 --> 00:01:25.305
- So we would ruin--

00:01:25.305 --> 00:01:28.474
- They were would yell
or like killing us here.

00:01:28.474 --> 00:01:29.307
- It was very warm

00:01:29.307 --> 00:01:30.890
but you guys won't hear
any of the dialogue.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:32.956
- No, no, no, a lot of crackling

00:01:32.956 --> 00:01:35.639
and shorting out through most of the film.

